NAME

del - Remove files and directories

SYNOPSIS

    del [-r|--recursive] <file|directory>...

DESCRIPTION

Remove files and directories.

OPTIONS

    -r, --recursive — Remove a directory tree; without it only empty directories are removed.
    -h, --help — Show this help.

NOTES

Targets run in order; failures do not stop later targets.
Duplicates and targets already removed by an earlier recursive operand fail explicitly.
When run from Shoot, unquoted pathname patterns expand before del starts; unmatched patterns stay literal and hidden names require an explicit leading dot.
Use -- before a target beginning with a hyphen.

